   "date": "2004-12-06T04:36:13-06:00",
   "body": "By now you should know that linen cloth drops from Defias rogues, kobolds, and gnolls.  The quest does not care how you come by the linen.  I suppose you could be given the items, but I collected them during one of the many kill X kobolds/gnolls/Dafias rogue quests in Westfall or the Elwynn Forest, and killed two birds with one stone.",
